Package: nhsbsa
Title: Client for the NHS Business Services Authority Open Data Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alasdair", "Warwick", , "alasdair.warwick06@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0800-2890"))
Description: A low-level client for the NHS Business Services Authority
    (NHSBSA) Open Data Portal <https://opendata.nhsbsa.net>, a 'CKAN' data
    catalogue. Provides thin wrappers around the portal's API actions for
    listing datasets, retrieving metadata, querying the datastore and
    downloading resource files. Results are returned as plain data
    (tibbles and lists) for the caller to interpret.
